# Regex patterns of URLs the `build-and-test.yml` lychee job must not check
# in dist/.

# PostHog reverse proxy: emitted as a <link rel="preconnect"> in the head of
# every production build. lychee reads the `href` of every <link> regardless
# of `rel`, but the proxy's root path is not a browsable page — it only
# serves the SDK under /static/ and the ingestion/config APIs — so it would
# fail the build on a link that was never meant to be one.
^https://hogpost\.naomakers\.com
